{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27146","headline":"送郭秀才归金陵 · 周贺","name":"送郭秀才归金陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏後客堂黄叶多，又怀家国起悲歌。\n酒前欲别语难尽，云际相思心若何。\n鸟下独山秋寺磬，人随大舸晚江波。\n南徐旧业几时到，门掩残阳积翠萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}